WHO   — Sarris — the warlord who knows it's real
WHAT  — The real threat the actors can't bluff: a villain who doesn't care that they're 'just actors,' which is exactly what forces them to become real.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
